.SH NAME / NOMBRE
i-Haklab \- Ivam3 hacking laboratory containing open-source tools / laboratorio de hacking de Ivam3 con herramientas open-source
.
.SH SYNOPSIS / SINOPSIS
.B i-Haklab
.RI [ OPTION ]...
.RI [ ARG ]
.br
.RI [ DIRECT-COMMAND ]
.RI [ ARGS ]...
.
.SH DESCRIPTION / DESCRIPCI\['O]N
i-Haklab v3.13 (c) 2026 by @Ivam3 is a hacking laboratory containing open-source tools recommended by Ivam3.
Transporta aplicaciones, herramientas y frameworks de un entorno Linux al alcance de la mano gracias a Android + Termux.
.br
If the law is violated with its use, this would be the responsibility of the user who handled it. / Si se viola la ley con su uso, ser\['a] responsabilidad del usuario.
.br
Uses Oh-My-Fish (fish) as default interactive shell; user can switch to zsh or bash with
.B i-Haklab setshell.
See
.BR fish (1),
.BR zsh (1),
.BR bash (1).
.PP
Syntax / Sintaxis:
.PP
.B i-Haklab [-option-] [-args-]
.br
.B <direct-command> [args]  " (sin prefijo i-Haklab)"
.PP
Project / Proyecto: https://github.com/ivam3/i-Haklab
.br
Docs \& support / Soporte: https://t.me/Ivam3by_Cinderella  |  https://t.me/Ivam3_Bot
.
.SH OPTIONS / OPCIONES
.
.SS Setting Options / Opciones de Configuraci\['o]n
.TP
.B about <name-of-tool>
Show information about a specific tool or framework.
Muestra informaci\['o]n detallada de una herramienta/framework.
.br
Uses
.B glow
to render markdown from
.I ~/.local/etc/i-Haklab/Tools/Readme/<tool>.md
(fetched on demand from iHDB).
Example / Ejemplo:
.B i-Haklab about crunch
.RS
.B i-Haklab about nmap
.RE
.TP
.B aptup
Update Termux manually, package by package.
Actualiza Termux paquete por paquete (alternativa a apt upgrade).
.TP
.B help
Show this help menu.
Muestra el men\['u] de ayuda (functions helpper).
.TP
.B passwd set|new
Set or change the Termux login.
Configura/cambia el login de Termux.
.B set
chooses Password/Fingerprint/Disable; 
.B new
asks for new password (AES-256-CBC, 100k iterations).
Example / Ejemplo:
.B i-Haklab passwd set
.RS
Password default: Ivam3byCinderella. Stored in
.I ~/.local/etc/i-Haklab/.Ivam3byCinderella
.RE
.TP
.B pd <distro> [X11] | pd list
Run a Linux distribution in proot environment.
Ejecuta una distribuci\['o]n Linux en proot.
.B list
shows all available distros.
.B X11
starts graphical environment (requires Termux:Wayland).
Examples / Ejemplos:
.B i-Haklab pd alpine
.RS
.B i-Haklab pd alpine X11
.br
.B i-Haklab pd list
.RE
.TP
.B setapikey
Set API keys to use in i-Haklab features.
Configura API keys (phonescan, deepseek, chatGPT, gemini, claude, mistralAI, groq, openrouter, kimi, testsprite, etc.) stored in
.I ~/.local/etc/i-Haklab/variables
as
.B APIKEY_*
.TP
.B setbanner
Enable, disable and customize the i-Haklab wall banner.
Activa/desactiva/personaliza el banner de inicio.
.TP
.B setshell
Switch shell between bash, zsh and fish (default).
Cambia de shell entre bash, zsh y fish (por defecto).
.br
Uses
.I ~/.local/libexec/i-Haklab/setshell
and
.I ~/.local/etc/fish/config.fish .
.TP
.B setuser
Set the i-Haklab username.
Configura el nombre de usuario mostrado en el banner.
.TP
.B show alltools|instatools|books|tutorials
List available tools, installed tools, books or tutorials.
Lista herramientas disponibles/instaladas, libros y tutoriales.
.RS
.B alltools
\- grid categorized from
.I ~/.local/etc/i-Haklab/Tools/listoftools
and
.I categories
(165 tools, fetches iHDB on each call).
.B instatools
\- lists installed packages via pkg.
.B books
\- downloads from
.I listofbooks
(mega.nz).
.B tutorials
\- lists from
.I listoftutorials
(YouTube/Telegram).
.RE
.TP
.B speedtest
Run a network speed test.
Ejecuta test de velocidad de red.
.TP
.B version
Show the current version of i-Haklab installed.
Muestra la versi\['o]n instalada (v3.13).
.TP
.B Xwayland
Run X server over Termux:Wayland app with XFCE4 as window manager.
Inicia servidor X con XFCE4 (requiere Termux:Wayland).
.br
Install first / Instalar primero:
.B apt install termux-desktop-xfce
.
.SS Automatization Options / Opciones de Automatizaci\['o]n
.TP
.B apkactivity <path/to/file.apk>
Get the main activity from an APK file.
Obtiene la actividad principal de un .apk (aapt/axmlprinter2).
.TP
.B androforensic secretCodes|airscope|dumpsys|extract <target>
Extract information from Android devices via ADB.
Extrae informaci\['o]n de dispositivos Android v\['i]a ADB.
.RS
.B secretCodes
\- scan installed packages for secret dialer codes.
.B airscope
\- Wi-Fi radar via ADB.
.B dumpsys
\- dump system information.
.B extract
\- data extraction & system snapshot.
Example / Ejemplo:
.B i-Haklab androforensic dumpsys 192.168.1.58:41771
.RE
.TP
.B backup create|restore
Create or restore a backup of Termux.
Crea o restaura backup de Termux.
.B create in|ex
(internal/external sdcard).
.B restore <path/to/file.tar.gz>
.TP
.B binchecker
Get information about BINs (CC, DC).
Consulta informaci\['o]n de BINs (tarjetas).
.TP
.B bruteforce ftp|mail|ssh|telnet
Brute force attack helpers.
Automatiza ataques de fuerza bruta a servidores.
Examples / Ejemplos:
.B i-Haklab bruteforce ftp
.RS
.B i-Haklab bruteforce mail ivam3@live.com
.RE
.TP
.B chatAI [-h|--help]
Connect with LLM APIs to interact via CLI.
Conecta con APIs de LLMs (OpenAI, Gemini, Deepseek, MistralAI, Ollama, etc.) v\['i]a CLI, gestiona m\['u]ltiples chats, crea im\['a]genes y recuerda conversaci\['o]n.
.br
Config keys: APIKEY_chatGPT, APIKEY_gemini, APIKEY_deepseek, APIKEY_mistralAI.
.TP
.B ESmsg encode|decode
Encode/decode secret message into an ASCII file.
Codifica/decodifica mensajes secretos en archivos ASCII (esteganograf\['i]a).
.TP
.B fakeID <options+args>
Create a fake identity card with a real email and phone number.
Crea identidad falsa con email/tel\['e]fono reales.
