.SH PACKAGE MANAGEMENT / GESTI\['O]N DE PAQUETES
i-Haklab integrates native and JS/Python ecosystems. All wrappers auto-configure via
.B pkg2conf
and normalize names via
.B ih_normalize_pkg
(functions).
.br
i-Haklab integra ecosistemas nativo y JS/Python. Todos los wrappers auto-configuran v\['i]a pkg2conf y normalizan nombres v\['i]a ih_normalize_pkg.
.SS apt wrapper / wrapper apt
.B ~/.local/bin/apt
intercepts install/reinstall/search/remove.
If package is a known pip/gem/npm/npx module, it suggests the correct manager and offers to run it. On install success calls
.B pkg2conf
if listed in
.I ~/.local/etc/i-Haklab/Tools/listofpkg2conf .
.PP
Mappings / Mapeos (apt:41-63):
.RS
.B pip:
bloodhound, frida, h8mail, hashid, holehe, mvt, objection, octosuite, orbitaldump, osrframework, phoneintel, scrapy, shodan, snscrape, speedtest-cli, sqlmap, wfuzz -> python3 -m pip install
.br
.B gem:
bettercap, aquatone -> gem install
.br
.B npm:
bash-obfuscate, codex, copilot-cli, gemini-cli, kimi-code, localtunnel, minimax-cli, n8n, pnpm, open-lovable, openspec, sleepwalker, qwen-code, testsprite, twifo-cli -> npm install -g (normalized)
.br
.B npx:
context7 (ctx7) -> npx
.RE
.PP
Examples / Ejemplos:
.B apt install nmap
.RS
.B apt install h8mail
-> suggests python3 -m pip install h8mail
.br
.B apt search sqlmap
.RE
.SS npm / pnpm wrappers
.B ~/.local/bin/npm
and
.B ~/.local/bin/pnpm
normalize via
.BR ih_normalize_pkg :
.RS
gemini-cli -> @google/gemini-cli, sleepwalker -> @sleepwalkerai/cli, qwen-code -> @qwen-code/qwen-code, openspec -> @fission-ai/openspec, kimi-code -> @moonshot-ai/kimi-code, claude-code -> @anthropic-ai/claude-code, codex -> @mmmbuto/codex-cli-termux@latest, copilot-cli|github-copilot -> @github/copilot, minimax-cli -> mmx-cli, smithery -> @smithery/cli, testsprite -> @testsprite/testsprite-mcp
.RE
.PP
Pre-install hooks via
.B ~/.local/libexec/preconf
: n8n (installs pm2/gyp, prepares ~/.n8n), open-lovable (clones firecrawl/open-lovable), testsprite (checks Node >=22), ai (hybrid-cli-ai). Post-uninstall via
.B ~/.local/libexec/cleanup
and post-install
.B pkg2conf
patch config (apache2, fish, gdb/peda, gh, mvt, radare2, tmux, tor, yt-dlp, etc.).
.PP
Usage / Uso:
.B npm install -g @google/gemini-cli
.RS
.B pnpm install -g @qwen-code/qwen-code
.br
.B npx ctx7@latest
(ephemeral, no install)
.br
.B pip install h8mail
(also via apt wrapper)
.RE
.
